sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Claude Code session
    participant H as priority-hook
    participant P as Spool
    participant L as Event log
    participant I as Interpreter
    participant N as Nemo (OpenRouter)
    participant K as Inkling (OpenRouter)

    S->>H: Stop hook fires
    H->>P: Write run.stopped to spool
    P->>L: POST /events (idempotency key)
    L-->>I: Follow delivers run.stopped
    I->>I: Slicer builds StopBrief from transcript (previous = last RunDigest, if any)

    alt All Nemo calls succeed and checks pass
        I->>N: Triage
        N-->>I: Triage reply
        I->>N: Pick
        N-->>I: Pick reply
        I->>N: Fill
        N-->>I: Fill reply
        I->>N: Card
        N-->>I: Card reply
        I->>I: Code checks kind and checks the quote is a substring of the Stop brief
        I->>L: Append interpretation event
    else Any call fails (429, malformed JSON, empty quote, timeout) or quote not in Stop brief
        N--xI: Failure
        I->>L: Append abstain event with logged reason
    end

    Note over I,K: At run end
    I->>K: DigestRun calls Digest
    alt Digest succeeds
        K-->>I: RunDigest
        I->>L: Append fact.run_digest (next StopBrief carries it as previous)
    else Digest fails
        K--xI: Failure
        I->>I: Log reason, previous stays empty, nothing blocked
    end
